<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ 'Bollettino Marca da Bollo'|trans }} — {{ app_entity.name|default('Ente') }}</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f0f2f5; }
    .page { max-width: 640px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px; padding: 32px; }
    .header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; border-bottom: 3px solid #0066cc; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .header-logo-box { width: 56px; height: 56px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #0066cc; border-radius: 8px; color: #fff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; overflow: hidden; }
    .header-logo-box img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
    .header-text h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0066cc; }
    .header-text p { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    .badge-mbt { display: inline-block; background: #0066cc; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .importo-box { text-align: center; border: 2px solid #0066cc; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; background: #f0f6ff; }
    .importo-box .lbl { font-size: 12px; color: #555; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .importo-box .amount { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 700; color: #0066cc; line-height: 1; }
    .fields { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .field .lbl { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .field .val { font-size: 13px; color: #1a1a1a; word-break: break-all; font-family: monospace; }
    .field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .field.full .val { font-family: inherit; }
    .doc-list { margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .doc-list li { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #e0e0e0; font-size: 13px; }
    .doc-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .doc-list .doc-num { font-weight: 700; color: #0066cc; font-size: 11px; min-width: 18px; }
    .doc-list .doc-price { margin-left: auto; font-weight: 600; color: #333; white-space: nowrap; }
    .qr-section { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 24px; }
    #qrcode-wrap { flex-shrink: 0; background: #fff; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; width: 176px; height: 176px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    #qrcode-wrap canvas, #qrcode-wrap img, #qrcode-wrap svg { display: block; }
    .qr-info { flex: 1; }
    .qr-info h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
    .qr-info p { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #555; line-height: 1.5; }
    .qr-string { font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; color: #666; word-break: break-all; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 5px 7px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 6px; }
    .actions { text-align: center; margin-top: 28px; }
    .btn-print { background: #0066cc; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 11px 28px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-print:hover { background: #0052a3; }
    .footer-note { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 11px; color: #666; border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8; padding-top: 12px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5; }
    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; }
      .page { margin: 0; border: none; border-radius: 0; padding: 16px; max-width: 100%; }
      .actions { display: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">

  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-logo-box">
      {% if app_logo is defined and app_logo.type == 'img' and app_logo.src is defined %}
        <img src="{{ app_logo.src }}" alt="">
      {% else %}
        {{ app_entity.name|default('E')|slice(0,1)|upper }}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="header-text">
      <h1>{{ app_entity.name|default('Ente') }}</h1>
      <p>{{ 'Bollettino pagoPA — Marca da Bollo Telematica'|trans }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div><span class="badge-mbt">{{ 'MARCA DA BOLLO TELEMATICA'|trans }}</span></div>

  <div class="importo-box">
    <div class="lbl">{{ 'Importo da pagare'|trans }}</div>
    <div class="amount">€ {{ importoEur }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="fields">
    <div class="field">
      <div class="lbl">{{ 'Numero avviso (IUV)'|trans }}</div>
      <div class="val">{{ iuv }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <div class="lbl">{{ 'Codice ente'|trans }}</div>
      <div class="val">{{ ente }}</div>
    </div>
    {% if causale %}
    <div class="field full">
      <div class="lbl">{{ 'Causale'|trans }}</div>
      <div class="val">{{ causale }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if cfDeb %}
    <div class="field">
      <div class="lbl">{{ 'Soggetto pagatore'|trans }}</div>
      <div class="val">{{ cfDeb }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if scadenza %}
    <div class="field">
      <div class="lbl">{{ 'Scadenza'|trans }}</div>
      <div class="val">{{ scadenza }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if desc is defined and desc|length > 0 %}
    <div class="field full">
      <div class="lbl">{{ 'Documenti'|trans }}</div>
      <ul class="doc-list">
        {% for d in desc %}
          <li>
            <span class="doc-num">{{ loop.index }}.</span>
            <span>{{ d }}</span>
            <span class="doc-price">€ 16,00</span>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="qr-section">
    <div id="qrcode-wrap">
      <div id="qrcode" role="img" aria-label="{{ 'Codice QR del pagamento pagoPA'|trans }}"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="qr-info">
      <h2>{{ 'Paga con il QR code'|trans }}</h2>
      <p>{{ 'Scansiona il codice con l\'app IO o con un terminale POS abilitato pagoPA per avviare il pagamento.'|trans }}</p>
      <p>{{ 'In alternativa, vai su pagopa.gov.it e inserisci il numero avviso e il codice ente sopra indicati.'|trans }}</p>
      <div class="qr-string">{{ qrString }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn-print" id="btn-print">{{ '🖨 Stampa / Salva come PDF'|trans }}</button>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">
    {{ 'Bollettino generato da'|trans }} {{ app_entity.name|default('Ente') }} {{ 'tramite il circuito ufficiale pagoPA.'|trans }}<br>
    {{ 'Conserva la ricevuta di pagamento come prova dell\'avvenuto versamento.'|trans }}
  </div>

</div>

{% set fo_qr = qrString %}
{% include 'partials/fo-data.html.twig' %}
<script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/fo/vendor/qrcode.min.js') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/fo/avviso-bollo.js') }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
